consumer(path=>path.startsWith(cert),'The issuing manager creates a keypair for keyType and submits a PodCertificateRequest with Pod, ServiceAccount and node identity, signerName, authored maximum lifetime pointer and annotations. Lookup is indexed by Pod UID, volume and source position; absent credentials fail until issuance supplies a valid state. The no-op manager returns unimplemented. Key bytes and issued certificate bytes are separate from API acceptance.',[source('pkg/kubelet/podcertificate/podcertificatemanager.go','736-820','Certificate request construction forwards exact identity/source settings and bundle retrieval fails before credentials exist.'),source('pkg/kubelet/podcertificate/podcertificatemanager.go','987-997','No-op certificate manager is an explicit unavailable-operation boundary.')],['Certificate issuance, feature gates']);
consumer(path=>path.includes('.affinity.podAffinity')||path.includes('.affinity.podAntiAffinity')||path.startsWith(`${p}.topologySpreadConstraints`),'On Pod create, enabled API selector mutation appends In requirements for matchLabelKeys and NotIn requirements for mismatchLabelKeys whose keys exist in Pod labels. Absent keys add no expression; a nil selector remains match-none. Topology selector mutation additionally requires both topology MatchLabelKeys and selector-merge gates. Added expressions AND with the authored selector.',[source('pkg/registry/core/pod/strategy.go','857-925','Pod-create selector mutation looks up incoming Pod labels and appends In/NotIn requirements conditionally.')]);
