consumer(path=>path.startsWith(`${p}.imagePullSecrets`),'The node credential builder accepts nonempty .dockerconfigjson only from kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson Secrets and nonempty .dockercfg only from kubernetes.io/dockercfg Secrets. Malformed JSON returns an error; other types or missing/empty credential keys add no Secret keyring. Valid Secret credentials are combined with the node default keyring. Registry authentication still depends on the selected image registry and actual credential validity.',[source('pkg/credentialprovider/secrets/secrets.go','29-78','Actual Secret credential extraction, JSON error handling and keyring union.')]);

